// ===========================================================================
// === region:shell — subcommand registry + main dispatch ===
// ===========================================================================
// Subcommand registry (ADR 0014) — the single source of truth for the CLI command
// set. main() dispatches through this map, and `Object.keys(COMMANDS)` is exactly
// the canonical set `lint-cli-doc` asserts docs/guide/cli.md documents. Adding a
// subcommand = one entry here (and a docs/guide/cli.md row, or lint-cli-doc fails CI).
// The -h/--help/help aliases are handled in main() and are deliberately NOT entries.
// ===========================================================================
